<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>A Special Message for You!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #74ebe5 0%, #d4f1f4 100%);
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 { color: #05445e; }
        p { color: #189ad3; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>Hello, [Friend's Name]! 👋</h1>
        <p>Hope you are having an amazing day! Thanks for being an awesome friend.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
